# Signed out, the sign-in page; 登录或注册 pressed: the login page goes to the browser (browser.cmd), which comes back to
# the app's loopback listener; the sign-in finished, Home with the test chat and the agent's first answer.
timeout 60000
until 登录或注册
shot 1-signed-out
tap 登录或注册
timeout 90000
gone 登录或注册
#station until 端到端测试
#station until 你好，我是测试用的 agent
wait 3000
shot 2-home
exit
